We use some of these short forms (especially ’s) after question words ( who /what  etc.) and after  
that /there /here :
who ’s what ’s where ’s how ’s that ’s there ’s here ’s who ’ll there ’ll who ’d
Who’s  that woman over there?  (= who is)
