Question tags  (do you ? isn’t it ? etc.)
):
‘Karen plays the piano, does n’t she?’ ‘Well, yes, but not very well.’
‘You didn’t lock the door, did you?’ ‘No, I forgot.’No, I haven’t.You haven’t seen
